  name: Faisan Puzzle
  messages:
  - character: 1
    mood: 5
    text: "\xA1Magn\xEDfico!\xA1Esplendido! Al fin mi hogar se ve devuelto a la gloria
      de anta\xF1o. Te hago entrega de tu merecida recompensa Momotaro, pero espero
      que hayas aprendido la lecci\xF3n mortal. \xA1No ser\xE9 tan benevolente la
      pr\xF3xima vez!"
    textEn: Magnificent! Splendid! At last my home is restored to its former glory.
      I present you with your well-deserved reward, Momotaro, but I hope you have
      learned your mortal lesson. I will not be so lenient next time!
    textFr: "Magnifique ! Splendide ! Enfin, ma demeure a retrouv\xE9 sa splendeur
      d'antan. Je te pr\xE9sente ta r\xE9compense bien m\xE9rit\xE9e, Momotaro, mais
      j'esp\xE8re que tu as retenu la le\xE7on. Je ne serai pas aussi cl\xE9ment
      la prochaine fois !"
    auto: 0
    duration: 0
  - character: 0
    mood: 3
